## Branches & deploy

| Branch | Purpose | Where it goes |
|---|---|---|
| `<DEFAULT_BASE_BRANCH>` | Daily integration | TestFlight via Fastlane (`fastlane beta`) |
| `main` | Production releases | App Store via Fastlane (`fastlane release`) |
| `feature/*` | Per-task feature branches | merge → `<DEFAULT_BASE_BRANCH>` |
| `release/*` | Release candidates | merge → `main`, then tag |
| `hotfix/*` | Production hotfixes | merge → `main` AND `<DEFAULT_BASE_BRANCH>` |

